  "body": "This revision ties subscriptions to a service worker registration\r\ninstead of a service worker version. Since multiple service workers at\r\ndifferent lifecycle stages may co-exist, it is difficult to reason about\r\nhow to reconcile subscription/unsubscriptions from each service worker.\r\nAssociating the subscriptions to the registration is clearer since only\r\n1 registration exists at a time.",
